Third-party content

- News reports are not redistributed. The repository gives each report's URL,
  outlet, date and headline. Claim units and their sentence spans are short
  excerpts of the reports, included for research; rights in the report text
  remain with the outlets.
- The official texts in data/sources/ (press releases and decision texts) were
  collected from the public websites of the issuing bodies (cbar.az, taxes.gov.az,
  sosial.gov.az, president.az). They remain subject to the terms of their
  original publishers.

